    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tribute to the old-school cRPG grind, BBS MUDs of the 1990s and early MMORPGs.\u00a0 Developed by a solo newbie developer, Landonia is a single-player, turn-based RPG that includes possibilities of parties upto 16 player-characters, treasures, grinding, questing, and classic cRPG play.\u00a0 \u00a0There are numerous factions that can be allied with or fought against, and NPCs will battle each other if the circumstances arise.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Game has three separate modes of combat:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Default) ARPG style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control 1 player in continuous mode, with (upto-15) party members supporting you automatically based upon your party settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-Based + Party AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mode is just like ARPG style but the game pauses when it's your character's turn. Party members will automatically support based upon your settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Turn-Based (Turn-Based + Party Manual).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control every player when it is their turn to move. It will automatically switch to the party member whose turn it is.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tribute to the old-school cRPG grind, BBS MUDs of the 1990s and early MMORPGs.\u00a0 Developed by a solo newbie developer, Landonia is a single-player, turn-based RPG that includes possibilities of parties upto 16 player-characters, treasures, grinding, questing, and classic cRPG play.\u00a0 \u00a0There are numerous factions that can be allied with or fought against, and NPCs will battle each other if the circumstances arise.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Game has three separate modes of combat:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Default) ARPG style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control 1 player in continuous mode, with (upto-15) party members supporting you automatically based upon your party settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-Based + Party AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mode is just like ARPG style but the game pauses when it's your character's turn. Party members will automatically support based upon your settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Turn-Based (Turn-Based + Party Manual).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control every player when it is their turn to move. It will automatically switch to the party member whose turn it is.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Developed by a solo newbie developer, Landonia is a single-player, cRPG that includes parties upto 16 player characters, exploration, loot, factions, level grinding, and class-based progression.\u00a0 There are different modes of play including ARPG style, ARPG + pause, and classic turn-based style.",
